            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Пропусти цикл, проверив в его условии <code>autopilotOn</code>, начальное значение которого равно <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autopilotOn = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (autopilotOn === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Autopilot on: vroom!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" autopilotOn = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keepPlaying\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>autopilotOn</code>, а затем <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
